# =============================================================================
# Eclipse Mosquitto  (eclipse-mosquitto)
# =============================================================================
# Mosquitto is configured entirely through mosquitto.conf — the image does NOT
# interpolate environment variables into its configuration.  The vars below are
# Alpine/container-level settings only.

# --- Permissions (Alpine — when running as root) ---
# PUID=1883                            # UID the broker process runs as
# PGID=1883                            # GID the broker process runs as
